{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43607","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 崇仁坊资圣寺 诸画联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 崇仁坊资圣寺 诸画联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴生画勇矛戟攒，出变奇势千万端。\n苍苍鬼怪层壁宽，覩之忽忽毛发寒。\n棱伽之力所疲殚，李真周昉优劣难。\n活禽生卉推边鸾，花房嫩彩犹未乾。\n韩干变态如激湍，惜哉壁画世未殚。\n後人新画何汗漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}